#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/phonon-backend-vlc.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This package provides a <application>Phonon</application> backend which "
"utilizes the <application>VLC</application> media framework."
